---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Make My Kerala"
  description="Terms and conditions for booking tours and travel packages with Make My Kerala."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="legal-page">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
        </nav>
        <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p>Last updated: September 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-content-section">
      <div class="container legal-body">
        <h2>1. Booking Confirmation & Payment</h2>
        <p>
          A tour booking is confirmed upon receipt of the agreed advance deposit. The balance amount is payable as outlined in your personalized booking voucher (typically prior to or upon arrival in Kerala).
        </p>

        <h2>2. Inclusions & Exclusions</h2>
        <p>
          Every tour package quotation clearly specifies included services: accommodation category, meal plans, private dedicated air-conditioned vehicle with driver allowances, tolls, and parking. Personal expenses, optional activity entry tickets, and gratuities are excluded unless specifically stated.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Itinerary Alterations</h2>
        <p>
          While we make every effort to follow the agreed schedule, unforeseen weather conditions, road closures, or government regulations in the Western Ghats or backwaters may necessitate minor itinerary adjustments. Our team will coordinate with you to ensure equal or superior alternatives.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Cancellation & Refund Policy</h2>
        <p>
          Cancellations received 15 days or more prior to arrival are eligible for refunds minus applicable hotel non-refundable retention charges and administrative fees. Detailed cancellation terms will be attached to your customized booking confirmation.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          For any questions regarding these terms, please contact our Kochi office at <a href="mailto:hello@makemykerala.com">hello@makemykerala.com</a> or <a href="tel:+919876543210">+91 98765 43210</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: #f7f5ed;
    min-height: 80vh;
  }

  .legal-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #092e22 0%, #12382a 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: 65px 0 50px;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .breadcrumb .current {
    color: #f1c47b;
  }

  .legal-hero h1 {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .legal-hero p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #f1c47b;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-content-section {
    padding: 60px 0 90px;
  }

  .legal-body {
    max-width: 820px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 45px 50px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(18, 56, 42, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(18, 56, 42, 0.08);
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #12382a;
    margin: 28px 0 12px;
  }

  .legal-body h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-body p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #556b60;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: #c98b36;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .legal-body {
      padding: 30px 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
